  'process.process': `
process: child process
pid: child process ID
stdin-fd: fd for writing to the child process standard input (-1=not connected)
stdout-fd: fd for reading the child process standard output (-1=not connected)
stderr-fd: fd for reading the child process standard error (-1=not connected)
