https-server-conn: HTTPS server-side connection
tls: underlying TLS connection
method: request method
path: request path
query: query string
version: HTTP version
headers: raw header string
header-names: parsed header names
header-values: parsed header values
header-count: number of headers
body: request body
keep-alive: whether to keep the connection alive
recv-buf: receive buffer
recv-buf-len: actual data length in the buffer
`
