new: the new substring
n: the maximum number of replacements; n <= 0 replaces nothing
returns val: the resulting string
`
  'str.replace-str': `
replaces every occurrence of the substring old in s with new
old: the substring to replace
new: the replacement
returns val: the resulting string
When old is the empty string, returns a copy of the original string unchanged
