key: the key to query
found: whether the document contains that key
`
  'toml.make-entry': `
copies key/value into a fixed buffer.
key: key string
value: value string
e: new entry after the key/value is copied into the fixed buffer
`
  'toml.new': `
Creates an empty TOML document
doc: an empty TOML document (0 entries, 0 tables)
`
  'toml.next-array-table': `
get and register the next index of an array-of-tables.
doc: current document
name: array-of-tables name
idx: ok=index of this element (auto-incremented registration), nil=same-named table not found and capacity full
`
