Parse a bare / quoted / dotted key and output a canonical dotted key.
s: raw key text (bare / quoted / dotted)
key: ok=canonical dotted key, nil=error message for an invalid key
`
  'toml.parse': `
Parses a TOML document; returns err(message) on failure
s: full TOML text
result: ok=the parsed document, err=error message carrying the cause
`
  'toml.parse-bool': `
parses a boolean value
