nd: node to append
idx: the node's index in the node pool
`
  'yaml.parser.push-null': `
Appends an empty node (null)
idx: pool index of the newly created null node
`
  'yaml.parser.push-scalar': `
Constructs a scalar node based on style and tag
text: scalar text
style: scalar style (YAML-STYLE-* constants)
